# Get Medieval (KCD), 30 min of real streamed gameplay on the release policy with the capture card on its standard 2560x1440 mode at 59.95 Hz instead of the custom 60.000 Hz one, b:vsync on the defaults (source rate not declared, 60 assumed; comb lock, 75 ms extra lag, flip timing and dejitter on) 2026-09-24, phase 7 build 62075d8; cut 600 s to 2400 s of a 2 h stream
# units: microseconds. first value absolute, rest are deltas.
description Get Medieval (KCD), 30 min of real streamed gameplay on the release policy with the capture card on its standard 2560x1440 mode at 59.95 Hz instead of the custom 60.000 Hz one, b:vsync on the defaults (source rate not declared, 60 assumed; comb lock, 75 ms extra lag, flip timing and dejitter on) 2026-09-24, phase 7 build 62075d8; cut 600 s to 2400 s of a 2 h stream
# What the RELAY did on this capture. The replay model is only trustworthy
# for a configuration where it reproduces these; the test checks that.
field_worst_run 44
field_long_runs 0
field_synth_pct 0.7
field_pull_wraps 104
#
# WHAT IT COVERS: the lock with a 60 fps source going into a 59.95 Hz output. The card's standard
# 2560x1440 mode runs at 59.95 Hz, so the source gains a frame about every 20 s and the pull has
# to wrap each time: 104 wraps in these 30 minutes, where the 60.000 Hz streams wrapped 30 to 50
# times an hour. No band prevents these wraps; a wider band only moves each one later in the
# beat. What the fixture pins is everything else: one wrap per beat, no back and forth, no long
# blend runs.
#
# WINDOW. Log time 600 s to 2400 s of a stream that ran to 7306 s, all gameplay: no second in the
# window holds more than 122 arrivals, so no desktop time is inside.
#
# FIDELITY. On the comb/16 band the stream ran with, the replay reads synth 0.8% against 0.7%,
# worst run 44 against 44, runs >= 50 0 against 0, and pull wraps 103 against 104. The dejitter
# arm, which is how the stream ran, reads synth 0.7%.
#
# Bounds on the REPLAY (not the field), measured with the band above the comb at comb/8:
# inequalities, so an improvement passes and only a regression fails.
max_worst_run 44
max_long_runs 0
max_synth_pct 1.2
min_reseeds 38
max_pull_wraps 101
extra_lag_ms 75
